  = note: strong `shared` references drop their target when the last count drops, so a strong
    cycle would keep itself alive forever — and wolf has no cycle collector
    ([mem.shared.rc.2]). Break the back-edge: make this field `weak Object` (upgrade to
    reach the value without keeping it alive) or `handle Object` (a generational index that
    faults if the target is gone). If the structure is genuinely cyclic, keep the whole
    graph in one region instead — intra-region cycles are safe and freed wholesale
    ([mem.region.intra.1]).

